# Ban mau cau hinh FE. Copy thanh `.env` roi dien theo MOI TRUONG cua ban.
# `.env` KHONG con nam trong git (wiki 0112) — moi may va moi server tu giu ban rieng.

# ---------- May lap trinh vien (dev) ----------
# Neu de trong, code van chay: src/lib/api/config.ts fallback localhost:3001 khi NODE_ENV != production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
# API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:3001   # rewrite /api/* cua next.config.ts

# ---------- PROD (VPS 103.82.194.218, file /root/gmall/.env) ----------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://gmall.vn/api   # trinh duyet goi qua nginx, cookie cung-site (wiki 0108)
# API_INTERNAL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4001     # SSR goi thang BE, khong vong ra internet (wiki 0101)
#
# LUU Y: NEXT_PUBLIC_* duoc NUONG vao bundle luc BUILD, khong doc luc chay.
# Sua `.env` xong PHAI build lai, neu khong thi khong co tac dung gi.
